New: LEVEL View Assist with roll and tilt meters from the camera's own sensor, plus Double-tap → Level to move the lens to level or straight down. Osmo Action 6 support with live view, Normal 10-bit and D-Log M color with the official LUT, and an APERTURE control (not yet checked on a real Action 6). Osmo Nano no longer shows zoom controls. Fixed: live video stopping shortly after connecting, and clip delete in playback. Scopes and playback use less power.
